  "mapLive": true,
  "_about": "An angled-bracket race-sim dash with a music panel, generated by design/gen_vector.py (edit that and regenerate). One vdash effect layer draws the brackets, the segmented rev counter (0..8, red from the redline), the ring gauges (coolant, oil, fuel, boost), the middle bars (boost, torque, power; gone while the map shows), the music panel's plate, record and progress line; the numbers and words are text widgets. The octagon in the middle is the Waze map's window, opened without a rebuild (mapLive). The music panel shows the head unit's now playing (HmiMediaState: title, artist, time) and readouts while nothing plays (showWhen media / !media). Full screen: the theme's own clock, range and outside temperature along the bottom, BMW's gear letter left uncovered. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
